            "changelog_subtitle": "Interlude / Side B Update History",
            "changelog_v104_title": "v1.0.4 — Audio Expansion (3 BGMs & 5 SFX), Adult Sprites, & UI Polish",
            "changelog_v104_body": "• Added 3 new BGMs (9 BGMs total in Music Room): Rainy Night in the Bedroom, Echo of 1994 (Siti's Theme), & New Day Melody (Café).\n• Added 5 new SFX (14 SFX total): letter paper unfold, phone chime, wall clock tick-tock, pen writing, & teacup set-down.\n• Fixed Bukit Senja & Siti's Cassette CG transitions so backgrounds properly restore before sprites appear.\n• Item popups now automatically shift to the right side when only 1 character is on screen.\n• Added 3 post-timeskip adult/college sprites (Yara, Friend 1, & Friend 2 in Ch. 46–47) and lowered Main Menu left-panel opacity by 40%.",
            "changelog_v103_title": "v1.0.3 — Fullscreen Open Letters, Item Inspection, & UI Polish",
            "changelog_v103_body": "• Added 4 Open-Letter CGs (16 canonical CGs total: Old Shop Letter, Kai's Unsent Letters, Yara's Letter, & Single-Line Reply) with a dedicated fullscreen letter viewer rendering bilingual ID/EN text directly onto the drawn paper.\n• All 13 item & food popups are now clickable/tappable to open a detailed cultural & lore info card.\n• Lowered dialogue window & nameplate opacity (~73%) for a lighter, more breathable view of backgrounds and characters.\n• Restored the Skip button to the bottom quick menu (automatically pauses at choices and cassette playback).",
            "changelog_v102_title": "v1.0.2 — Android Polish, Full Cassette VO, & UX Refinements",
            "changelog_v102_body": "• Fixed Android Save/Load crash (converted speaker dim callbacks to picklable top-level classes).\n• Added left-edge (~20%) tap/click zone to Rollback (Back), with center/right advancing the story.\n• Matched Android ultrawide side-bar color to warm dark espresso (#16100c).\n• Widened left/center/right sprite spacing so 2–3 characters never crowd or overlap.\n• Full integration of all 122 visual assets & 21 audio files (6 voiced Side A & Side B cassette tapes with synced durations, and 19 achievements).\n• Added 41 spoiler-free custom choice cards for all major & conditional gates, split 33 long paragraphs (ID & EN), and added this Changelog screen.",
            "changelog_v101_title": "v1.0.1 — Expanded CGs, Supporting NPCs, & Item Popups",
            "changelog_v101_body": "• Added 6 expansion CGs (12 canonical CGs total), 9 supporting NPC sprites, and 13 item & food popups.\n• Added active-speaker spotlight (25% dim overlay for non-speaking sprites).\n• Fullscreen CG view automatically hides sprites and dialogue UI.\n• Added main menu BGM, smoother Auto-Play pacing, floating top nameplate, and updated Stasiun Malang Kota Lama naming.",
            "changelog_v100_title": "v1.0.0 — Full Initial Release (ID & EN)",
            "changelog_v100_body": "• Complete 48 chapters, 12 major gates (531,441 combinations), 2 conditional gates, 23 minor gates, and 5 canonical endings.\n• Independent dual-language UI & Story switching (Indonesian & English) + 44-term cultural glossary.\n• Interactive cassette player with full transcripts, CG Gallery, Music Room, and Achievements.",
            "about_title": "About",
            "about_btn_credits": "View Credits",
            "glossary_title": "Javanese & Local Terms Glossary",
            "glossary_intro": "East Javanese (Malang) expressions and local cultural terms kept untranslated in both the Indonesian and English versions of the story.",
            "glossary_count_note": "{count} canonical story terms (Chapters 1–48).",
            "about_synopsis_title": "About Interlude / Side B",
            "about_synopsis_body": "At the end of an ever-wet dead-end alley in Malang, Toko Gema Masa sells cassette tapes carrying 60 seconds of sound from tomorrow — at a price not always paid in money. Interlude / Side B is a story about Kai, Yara, Pak Ageng, anxiety over tomorrow, and the courage to listen to today as it is.",
            "about_system_title": "Choice System & Dual Language",
            "about_system_body": "Your ending is determined transparently by the 12-major-gate evaluator (G1–G12) across 5 canonical endings. UI Language and Story Language can be switched independently in Settings without restarting. Every cassette scene always displays a full on-screen transcript.",
